From 9b0a905efe14764523e5eb0e269512286c17f6c0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mcsm <mcsm@localhost>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 11:37:55 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] impeller (mcsm7): GLES runs several colour attachments in
 one pass (attachments 1..N on the cached FBO, draw buffers, a clear per
 attachment, per-buffer blend state where the driver has it, discards); Metal
 re-arms the same pipeline without encoder calls and keeps its binding cache
 in flat arrays

